    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d99-a2">

                <pb facs="0267" n="133" xml:id="pg133"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No.
                        779.—Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Señor Zelaya to Mr. Hall.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tegucigalpa</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-02-19"><hi rendition="#italic">February</hi> 19,
                        1888</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have asked for information from Puerto Cortes and Truxillo, in order to reply
                    with certainty to your telegram respecting Vivorilia Key.</p>
                <p>Your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Jeronimo Zelaya.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
